{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202661yLDVG5n41793285821.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報微軟計劃發行債券，籌資至少250億美元。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，微軟擬在美國發行投資級債券集資至少250億美元，年期介乎2至40年不等。所得資金將用於一般公司用途及資本支出。微軟上一次發行投資級債券，是在2017年籌集170億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.373021+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:18:20.548792+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.604293+00:00","content_hash":"e324c56068ecca8d61f4695be65e9ebba4588bb3bfdf35d14cf005f34ffac6a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}